OL,3,AGlobal Microsoft outage hits schools,
OL,4,Adoctors and businesses as company
OL,5,Ascrambles to solve issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Microsoft outage, which has been
OL,8,Fgoing for at least 20 hours, is
OL,9,Faffecting services including Teams,
OL,10,FOutlook and AI software Copilot -
OL,11,Fhere's what we know
OL,13,FMicrosoft says it is continuing to see
OL,14,F"improvements in service availability"
OL,15,F- but some users may still have
OL,16,F"intermittent access issues". It says
OL,17,Fthere is no evidence any "malicious
OL,18,Factivity" caused the incident
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
