OL,3,AGlobal Microsoft outage hits schools,
OL,4,Adoctors and businesses as company
OL,5,Ascrambles to solve issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FNHS England says the outage is
OL,8,F"inevitably" disrupting staff - but
OL,9,Fappointments can continue; schools are
OL,10,Fasking parents to get in touch via
OL,11,Fphone not email; some businesses, such
OL,12,Fas Swiss luxury goods group Richemont,
OL,13,Fdelay announcing their quarterly
OL,14,Fresults
OL,16,FIn the US, local municipalities, the
OL,17,Ffederal government and court systems
OL,18,Fare among those reporting issues, with
OL,19,Fofficials saying they are unable to
OL,20,Fsend or receive emails
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
