OL,3,AGlobal Microsoft outage hits schools,
OL,4,Adoctors and businesses as company
OL,5,Ascrambles to solve issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FHow are you affected? Georgia, from
OL,8,FStaffordshire, says the outage has
OL,9,Fdelayed the completion of her first
OL,10,Fhouse purchase. Meanwhile, Martin says
OL,11,Fit was "bliss" to wake up to no emails
OL,12,F- before he realised "today is a
OL,13,Fcrucial day to conclude a business
OL,14,Fdeal"
